  "validation": "Paired scheduler and downstream builds, including refreshed production clients against current Cantor providers; 37 old declaration reports and scoped simp membership match; changed-byte clients have matching checked declaration interfaces. Independent proof and archive reviews included.",
  "limitations": [
    "This genuine proof deduplication adds two net source lines to retain existing public wrappers; two new helper names are visible earlier.",
    "Project, Foundation and package inputs remain cached; not all downstream clients or the global simp environment were rebuilt or compared.",
    "Two unchanged-source downstream object files differ by bytes; matching declaration type and axiom reports do not establish identical proof terms or all environment extensions.",
    "The first stable-interface probe source/logs were overwritten by a superseding probe and are excluded from reproducible evidence. Both documentation revisions are preserved.",
    "The initial independent archive check used an incorrect source path and failed after verifying the manifest; a corrected source snapshot check passed. Compiled objects and replay environment are excluded."
